//! Inference engine module root for the TML self-hosting type checker.
//!
//! Re-exports the core inference types and functions so consumers
//! can import from `compiler::types::infer::common` instead of
//! reaching into submodules directly.
//!
//! Note: named `common.tml` because `mod` is a reserved keyword in TML.
//!
//! Phase 14c — item 1.1.

